window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>When everything's on the line, can the pack still choose each other?</b></p> <p>After Meggie's ex fails to kidnap her, Pack Hart is faced with a difficult decision. Do they allow Meggie to stay on the water polo team and risk their own careers, or do they leave her behind and risk their pack?</p> <p>As tensions rise and more people become aware of Meggie's secret designation, the stakes are higher than ever. It's not just her reputation on the line, but the future of the entire pack.</p> <p><i>This book is part two of a duet that's a continuing story. With sizzling chemistry, this spicy omegaverse romance will have you listening all through the night. And with six swoon-worthy book boyfriends to choose from, you won't be able to resist falling in love.</i></p> <p><i>It features MMMMFMM, the Paris Olympics, water polo, a secret omega, teammates, spicy group scenes, surprise heat, grumpy/sunshine, he fights his attraction to her, sweet, funny, and all the summer vibes.</i></p>"; 
